WEBVTT

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:18.370
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

00:01:29.965 --> 00:01:31.175
Places, everyone.
各就各位

00:01:38.057 --> 00:01:39.600
(WHIRRING)

00:01:49.819 --> 00:01:52.071
(SINGING)

00:02:18.931 --> 00:02:20.432
BUSTER: This was it.
就是这一刻

00:02:20.516 --> 00:02:22.685
The moment it all began.
一切从这一刻开始

00:02:22.768 --> 00:02:26.397
The moment an ordinary little guy
fell in love with the theater.
一个平凡的家伙爱上了剧场

00:02:27.273 --> 00:02:28.607
Everything about it.
这里所有事物 灯光...

00:02:28.691 --> 00:02:29.733
The lights,
这里所有事物 灯光...

00:02:29.817 --> 00:02:32.862
the way the scenery moved, even the smell.
布景的变化 甚至是味道

00:02:32.945 --> 00:02:35.155
He was only six years old,
but his plans to become
他那时只有六岁 他原本的计划...

00:02:35.239 --> 00:02:38.450
the first koala bear in space
were suddenly toast.
想要成为第一只
登上月球的无尾熊...顿时改变

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:39.535
(CAMERA SHUTTER CLICKS)
想要成为第一只
登上月球的无尾熊...顿时改变

00:02:39.618 --> 00:02:42.204
Some folks may have said
he grew up to be the greatest showman
有些人认为他长大后成为
这城市最伟大的制作人

00:02:42.288 --> 00:02:43.789
the city has ever seen.
有些人认为他长大后成为
这城市最伟大的制作人

00:02:43.873 --> 00:02:46.083
Some called him a visionary, a maverick.
也有人称他为有远见
也特异独行的奇葩

00:02:47.626 --> 00:02:50.170
Sure, some folks said
he was as crazy as he was stubborn,
当然也有人认为他疯狂固执...

00:02:50.254 --> 00:02:54.049
but I say wonder and magic
don't come easy, pal.
我只能说奇幻的魔力
往往得来不易 朋友

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:56.635
And, oh, there would never be any doubt.
但无可置疑的是

00:02:56.719 --> 00:03:01.181
The name Buster Moon
would go down in entertainment history.
巴斯特穆恩这个名字
将在娱乐史上永垂不朽

00:03:01.265 --> 00:03:02.766
And I should know.
我应当最为清楚

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.102
Because I am Buster...
因为我就是巴斯特

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:07.688
-ANGRY CHIMPANZEE: Moon! Open this door!
-(POUNDING ON DOOR)
快开门！

00:03:08.147 --> 00:03:10.024
-Good morning, Mr. Moon.
-(ANIMALS CHATTERING ANGRILY)
早上好 穆恩先生

00:03:10.107 --> 00:03:12.735
Miss Crawly. What, uh... What's going on?
克劳利小姐 发生什么事了？

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:16.030
You got a lot of animals
waiting to see you, Mr. Moon.
有很多动物等着见你 穆恩先生

00:03:16.238 --> 00:03:17.364
I do?
是吗？

00:03:18.657 --> 00:03:20.659
Holy moly, I really do!
糟糕 真的是！

00:03:20.784 --> 00:03:23.454
MISS CRAWLY:
Yeah, it's the stage crew from your last show.
是的 都是你上一场影剧的
幕后工作人员

00:03:23.829 --> 00:03:25.539
They say their paychecks bounced.
他们说收到的支票无法兑现

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:27.166
Tell them I'll call up the bank and make sure
告诉他们我会联络银行
让他们立即能收到酬劳

00:03:27.249 --> 00:03:28.375
they're paid tout de suite.
告诉他们我会联络银行
让他们立即能收到酬劳

00:03:28.542 --> 00:03:32.296
Oh, I got Judith from the bank
holding on line two right now, sir.
哦 银行的朱迪思
已在二号线等候 先生

00:03:32.796 --> 00:03:34.423
Um, actually, I'm gonna have to call her back.
我待会再回她电话

00:03:34.548 --> 00:03:36.342
Oh. What should I tell her this time?
我这次该对她说什么？

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:38.886
Tell her Buster Moon is out to lunch.
告诉她巴斯特穆恩外出用餐了

00:03:39.595 --> 00:03:42.139
ANGRY CHIMPANZEE: Moon! Open this door!
穆恩！快开门！

00:03:44.058 --> 00:03:45.059
Come on, Moon!
拜托 穆恩！

00:03:45.434 --> 00:03:46.810
I know you're in there!
我知道你在里头！

00:03:57.196 --> 00:03:58.197
Moon!
穆恩！

00:03:58.364 --> 00:03:59.698
Open this door!
快开门！

00:04:02.785 --> 00:04:03.786
(GASPS)

00:04:09.917 --> 00:04:11.126
(BICYCLE BELL RINGING)

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:17.341
(ALL GASP)

00:04:34.858 --> 00:04:36.610
(SINGING ROCK SONG)

00:04:51.834 --> 00:04:52.835
(POLICE RADIO STATIC)

00:04:53.043 --> 00:04:54.169
(INDISTINCT POLICE RADIO CHATTER)

00:04:54.253 --> 00:04:55.254
(GASPS)

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:59.008
Mmm! Thought I heard
someone singing there.
我好像听到有人在那里唱歌

00:04:59.425 --> 00:05:00.634
Ah, whatever.
算了

00:05:01.969 --> 00:05:03.470
-(ALARM RINGING)
-(GASPS)

00:05:03.554 --> 00:05:04.596
Guys, listen!
各位 听着！
留在原地 警察就快到了...

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:06.432
Stay where you are. The cops are here...
各位 听着！
留在原地 警察就快到了...

00:05:07.641 --> 00:05:09.351
-What are you...
-Hold it right there!
-你在做什么...
-站住！

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:14.231
Go, go, go!
快走！

00:05:14.481 --> 00:05:15.983
(ENGINE STARTS)

00:05:18.402 --> 00:05:19.403
(SIREN WAILING)

00:05:20.029 --> 00:05:21.321
(PANTING) Whoa!

00:05:22.114 --> 00:05:24.658
Johnny, you were supposed
to be keeping a lookout!
强尼 你应该替我们把风！

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:25.951
Sorry, Dad.
抱歉 爸爸

00:05:26.118 --> 00:05:27.244
And where's your mask?
你的面具呢？

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:32.583
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:33.959
(SIRENS WAILING)

00:05:38.213 --> 00:05:39.173
(POP SONG PLAYING ON RADIO)

00:05:39.298 --> 00:05:40.299
(SINGING)

00:05:49.767 --> 00:05:51.977
Look at me, I'm Mommy!
看看我 我是妈妈！

00:05:52.061 --> 00:05:53.604
-(IMITATES SINGING)
-(PIGLETS LAUGH)
看看我 我是妈妈！

00:05:53.687 --> 00:05:55.189
Caspar, get off the table.
卡斯帕 快从桌上下来

00:05:55.564 --> 00:05:58.025
Rosita, have you seen my car keys?
罗西塔 你有看见我的车钥匙吗？

00:06:00.277 --> 00:06:01.945
(CONTINUES IMITATING SINGING)

00:06:02.196 --> 00:06:04.865
Norman, would you please tell them
what a good singer I am?
诺门 你能告诉孩子们
我唱歌很棒吗？

00:06:04.948 --> 00:06:06.825
Oh, yeah, you were great, honey.
是的 你的确很棒 亲爱的

00:06:07.284 --> 00:06:09.453
And by the way,
the bathroom sink is blocked again.
顺道一提 浴室水槽又阻塞了

00:06:10.329 --> 00:06:11.455
Bye, honey!
再见 亲爱的！

00:06:11.538 --> 00:06:13.207
-(PIGLETS CHATTERING)
-(SIGHS)

00:06:22.549 --> 00:06:24.927
One, two. One, two, three, four!
一二、一二三四！

